unt Setup - Global Markets","Process Step Description":"Ops reviews request, classifies route (FD/SA), urgency, sets SLA and assigns maker.","Data Involved":"Ticket metadata","Source BDEs":"Ticket Record","Target BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Data Transformed":"Routing tags applied","L4 Process Name":"Custody Account Setup - Global Markets"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02-S003","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02","Reorder":30,"Process Step":"Completeness gateway - Custody Account Setup - Global Markets","Process Step Description":"Mandatory fields/evidence check; fail → AOB-PR-1010-V02-S004, pass → AOB-PR-1010-V02-S005.","Data Involved":"Process attributes + evidence refs","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Pass/Fail decision","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Custody Account Setup - Global Markets"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02-S004","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02","Reorder":40,"Process Step":"Request clarification (fail path) - Custody Account Setup - Global Markets","Process Step Description":"Return to requestor with reason codes; loop to AOB-PR-1010-V02-S003.","Data Involved":"Missing field list","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Updated Ticket","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Custody Account Setup - Global Markets"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02-S005","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02","Reorder":50,"Process Step":"Business approval - Custody Account Setup - Global Markets","Process Step Description":"Business approver confirms request is valid and authorised.","Data Involved":"Key Process attributes","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Approved/Rejected","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"Custody Account Setup - Global Markets"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02-S006","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1010-V02","Reorder":60,"Process Step":"Approval event gateway - Custody Account Setup - Global Markets","Process Step Description":"Wait for approve/reject/withdraw/timeout; timeout → escalation.","Data Involv